OL,3,GNEWSAMan with links to crime boss
OL,4,Ajailed for role in #8m drugs raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted drug smuggler with links to
OL,7,Fa major gangster has been jailed for
OL,8,Fsix years for his role in an #8m
OL,9,Fcocaine bust.
OL,11,FCharles McAughey, 65, was arrested in
OL,12,FDecember after police discovered 100
OL,13,Fblocks of the Class A drug behind a
OL,14,Fhidden compartment in a lorry in
OL,15,FBellshill, North Lanarkshire.
OL,17,FMcAughey, who has connections to Jamie
OL,18,F"Iceman" Stevenson, admitted to being
OL,19,Finvolved in serious organised crime.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
