OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared in the dock at the High
OL,7,FCourt in Edinburgh alongside
OL,8,F29-year-old Scott Bannatyne, who was
OL,9,Fjailed for three years after he also
OL,10,Fadmitted drugs trafficking offences.
